  "description": "ASGL2 is a small 2D game library for .NET Framework built on SDL2: fixed-step game loop and game states, sprites and sprite sheets, tile maps (with a JSON map format and animated tiles), camera and parallax, particle effects, waypoints, input, audio, a retained-mode UI toolkit and a software 3D renderer. The SDL2 native libraries are NOT included, see the package readme.",
